This repository began as a GitHub fork of
Antniom/scilab-xcos-mcp-server. The current implementation does not include
source code, web assets, extracted help, block metadata, macros, or reference
diagrams from that project. That project remains configured only as the
external `upstream` remote and is not part of this branch's history or release
archives.

Scilab and Xcos are separate projects. Xcos MCP discovers and invokes an
installed copy at runtime; their files are not redistributed in the Python
package. Generated example diagrams and traces remain subject to any metadata
embedded by the Scilab/Xcos exporter.
